"fill='#b5443a' font-weight='bold'>11</text><text x='241' y='102'>12</"
"text><text x='295' y='102'>13</text><text x='349' y='102'>14</text></g><text "
"x='133' y='116' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='7' fill='#6d4f24'>09:00 "
"Doctor</text><text x='20' y='150' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='9' "
"fill='#5a4630'>Red outline: today</text><text x='20' y='166' font-"
"family='sans-serif' font-size='9' fill='#5a4630'>Small lines in each box: "
"that day's appointments</text><text x='20' y='182' font-family='sans-serif' "
"font-size='9' fill='#5a4630'>By default, click to open a new appointment</"
"text></svg><figcaption>The month view on the left-hand page.</figcaption></"
"figure><p><b>Today</b> is outlined in red. The first appointments of each "
"day appear in small type inside its box. A star <b>✱</b> indicates an "
"anniversary on that day.</p><p><b>With the keyboard:</b> Left and Right move "
"one day, Up and Down one week, Home and End to the first or last day of the "
"week, Page Up and Page Down one month, and Shift with Page Up or Page Down "
"one year. Enter or Space opens the focused date.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Kalender er delen du sannsynligvis bruker oftest. Hele måneden vises til "
"venstre, mens månedens avtaler er ordnet dag for dag i en oversikt til høyre."
"</p><figure><svg viewBox='0 0 430 210' width='430' height='210'><rect x='4' "
"y='4' width='422' height='202' fill='#f6efdc' stroke='#ab9468'/><text x='16' "
"y='24' font-family='Georgia,serif' font-size='15' fill='#3a3128'>Juli 2026</"
"text><line x1='12' y1='32' x2='418' y2='32' stroke='#d8b25c' stroke-"
"width='2'/><g font-family='sans-serif' font-size='8' fill='#93805d'><text "
"x='30' y='46'>MAN</text><text x='84' y='46'>TIR</text><text x='138' "
"y='46'>ONS</text><text x='192' y='46'>TOR</text><text x='246' y='46'>FRE</"
"text><text x='300' y='46'>LØR</text><text x='354' y='46'>SØN</text></g><g "
